"text":"No"},{"text":"More"},{"text":"Less"},{"text":"Reverse"},{"text":"As well as"},{"text":"Other than"}]},{"type":"h","text":"JSA / JHA"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to break jobs into:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Task","Hazard","Risk","Control"]},{"type":"h","text":"FMEA"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Failure mode"},{"text":"Failure effect"},{"text":"Failure cause"},{"text":"Existing controls"},{"text":"Severity"},{"text":"Occurrence"},{"text":"Detection"},{"text":"Risk prioritization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Bow-Tie Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Threats","Top Event","Consequences"]},{"type":"p","text":"with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive Barriers + Mitigative Barriers"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Professional Risk Assessor Preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus on applying risk assessment methods to realistic industrial environments."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Safety Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What-If Analysis"},{"text":"HAZOP"},{"text":"FMEA"},{"text":"Fault Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Event Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Bow-Tie Analysis"},{"text":"Job Safety Analysis"},{"text":"Layer of Protection Analysis"},{"text":"Quantitative Risk Assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Process Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"For students targeting high-hazard industries, learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process safety management concepts"},{"text":"Loss of containment"},{"text":"Pressure systems"},{"text":"Flammable materials"},{"text":"Toxic releases"},{"text":"Explosion hazards"},{"text":"Safety instrumented systems"},{"text":"Emergency shutdown concepts"},{"text":"Process alarms and interlocks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emergency Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emergency response plans"},{"text":"Evacuation planning"},{"text":"Fire emergency procedures"},{"text":"Incident command concepts"},{"text":"Emergency drills"},{"text":"Business continuity basics"},{"text":"Disaster preparedness"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Technical Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Fire Protection"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fire detection"},{"text":"Fire alarms"},{"text":"Fire extinguishers"},{"text":"Hydrant systems"},{"text":"Sprinkler systems"},{"text":"Fire pumps"},{"text":"Fire water systems"},{"text":"Foam systems"},{"text":"Gas-based suppression"},{"text":"Emergency lighting"},{"text":"Fire doors"},{"text":"Fire compartmentation"},{"text":"Smoke control"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand design principles and risk implications, while detailed system design should follow applicable codes, standards, and qualified professional practice."},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine guarding"},{"text":"Lockout/Tagout"},{"text":"Electrical safety"},{"text":"Work permits"},{"text":"Confined-space entry"},{"text":"Work at height"},{"text":"Hot work"},{"text":"Lifting operations"},{"text":"Excavation safety"},{"text":"Contractor safety"},{"text":"PPE"},{"text":"Chemical handling"}]}]},{"heading":"Risk Assessment Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Method","Application"],"rows":[[{"text":"Risk Matrix"},{"text":"General risk assessment"}],[{"text":"JSA/JHA"},{"text":"Task-level hazards"}],[{"text":"HAZID"},{"text":"Early hazard identification"}],[{"text":"HAZOP"},{"text":"Process hazards"}],[{"text":"FMEA"},{"text":"Equipment/process failures"}],[{"text":"FTA"},{"text":"Causes of top events"}],[{"text":"ETA"},{"text":"Consequence pathways"}],[{"text":"Bow-Tie"},{"text":"Barrier-based risk analysis"}],[{"text":"LOPA"},{"text":"Protection-layer analysis"}],[{"text":"QRA"},{"text":"Quantitative risk assessment"}]]}]},{"heading":"Software & Digital Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"