Evacuation"},{"text":"Produce a professional risk-assessment report."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — HAZOP Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simplified process system and perform:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Node identification"},{"text":"Parameter selection"},{"text":"Guide-word analysis"},{"text":"Causes"},{"text":"Consequences"},{"text":"Existing safeguards"},{"text":"Recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Bow-Tie Risk Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze a scenario such as:"},{"type":"p","text":"Loss of containment of a flammable substance."},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Threats","Preventive Barriers","Top Event","Mitigative Barriers","Consequences"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Safety Analytics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incident frequency"},{"text":"Severity"},{"text":"Near misses"},{"text":"Safety observations"},{"text":"Open risks"},{"text":"High-risk activities"},{"text":"Corrective-action status"},{"text":"Incident trends"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fire safety departments"},{"text":"Manufacturing facilities"},{"text":"Industrial safety teams"},{"text":"Safety training organizations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Safety Engineering Intern"},{"text":"Fire Safety Intern"},{"text":"HSE Intern"},{"text":"EHS Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk Assessment Intern"},{"text":"Process Safety Intern"},{"text":"Industrial Safety Intern"},{"text":"Safety Audit Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year"},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize internships involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HIRA"},{"text":"JSA/JHA"},{"text":"HAZOP"},{"text":"Safety audits"},{"text":"Incident investigation"},{"text":"Fire risk assessment"},{"text":"Emergency preparedness"},{"text":"Process safety"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong internship should result in actual risk registers, audit observations, safety studies, or documented improvement projects, subject to confidentiality and site-access rules."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After graduation, target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk Assessor"},{"text":"Safety Engineer"},{"text":"Fire Safety Engineer"},{"text":"HSE Engineer"},{"text":"EHS Engineer"},{"text":"Safety Officer"},{"text":"Process Safety Engineer"},{"text":"Loss Prevention Engineer"},{"text":"Safety Consultant"},{"text":"Fire Risk Consultant"},{"text":"Safety Compliance Engineer"},{"text":"Emergency Management Coordinator"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Some regulated or statutory safety positions may have additional qualification, experience, certification, or government/industry-specific eligibility requirements."}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Industry","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Oil & Gas"},{"text":"HAZOP, HIRA, QRA, process safety"}],[{"text":"Petrochemical"},{"text":"Process safety, fire protection, HAZOP"}],[{"text":"Chemical"},{"text":"Chemical risk, HAZOP, emergency response"}],[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"HIRA, JSA, machine safety, fire safety"}],[{"text":"Construction"},{"text":"Work-at-height, lifting, excavation, JSA"}],[{"text":"Power"},{"text":"Electrical safety, fire safety, risk assessment"}],[{"text":"Mining"},{"text":"Occupational safety, emergency response, risk"}],[{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Warehouse/fire risk, material handling"}],[{"text":"Infrastructure"},{"text":"Safety audits, construction risk"}],[{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Fire safety, emergency preparedness"}],[{"text":"Aviation"},{"text":"Safety management, emergency planning"}],[{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"